	(text "04_KELVIN_SENSE REV0.2 GATE E: DEC-032 K1 PRIMARY (DEC-029 reed <1pA latch OFF)" (at 9.91 9.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "K1: SENSE_HI->K301(reed N/C for test)->U401A OPA140 fol(5pF Cin, 10G) ->R401/R402 + U402 OPA140 diff G=1 (10k 0.1%) ->VDIFF_FB->LT1970 -IN (03)" (at 9.91 14.99 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "     SENSE_LO->K302->U401B ->R403/R404 ->same diff; C401 15p 10MHz pole; TP401/402/403; decoupling 100nF+10uF per OPA140" (at 9.91 20.07 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "K2 provision: U403 LT5400 MSOP-8 overlapping R401-404 footprint, DNP K1, FIT K2 for 0.01% CMRR 86dB (K1 54dB -> LT5400 86dB PRIMARY adequate, cal removes gain)" (at 9.91 24.89 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "K3 REJECTED: INA Ib 350pA-35nA fails 10pA budget @1GΩ (2%->35V error), INA116 800uV Vos 20uV/C drift slower" (at 9.91 29.97 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "Open-sense: weak 10M pull R405/R406 behind K301/K302 NO-> window comp U404 TLV3501 |Vdiff-Vforce|>0.5V flags OPEN_SENSE_FLAG -> SR latch (08 MCU) -> reeds OPEN before OUTPUT ON, latch OFF" (at 9.91 35.05 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "         Measurement mode: K301/K302 OPEN (Coff 1pF, <1pA) DUT sees only OPA140 Cin 5pF, no DC load (IR-03 switched, >=10G or disconnected). Fallback FORCE mode latched until SENS:REM ON + OUTPUT cycle." (at 9.91 39.88 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "Guard: SENSE pair guarded trace, keepout, stitching per GUARD_STRATEGY (not driven revA), leakage path OPA140 Ib + reed <2pA total." (at 9.91 44.96 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "Wiring: VDIFF_FB->03 LT1970 -IN, SENSE_HI/LO + FORCE_HI/LO from 09 DUT connector, OPEN_SENSE_FLAG + KELVIN_ENABLE from 08 MCU, supplies +-12V_A" (at 9.91 100.08 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
	(text "Simulation: vendor LT1970.sub + OPAx140.LIB gate E at +0.1V/+2V/-2V 100pF/1nF Riso47 10k CV + 100R CC (10mA) + 1k CC (50uA) - see vendor_lt1970_R5p1E" (at 9.91 104.90 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)))
